[{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"圆上的点到圆心的距离怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"距离都等于半径"},{"key":"B","text":"有的长有的短"},{"key":"C","text":"等于直径的 2 倍"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"同一圆里，所有半径一样长。","id":"cnm_p188_q1","topicId":"cnm_p188"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"在同一个圆里，半径是 4 厘米，直径是多少厘米？","answer":"8","explanation":"直径＝半径×2＝8。","verify":"4*2","id":"cnm_p188_q2","topicId":"cnm_p188"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个圆的直径是 10 厘米。它的半径是多少厘米？","answer":"5","explanation":"半径＝直径÷2＝5。","verify":"10/2","id":"cnm_p188_q3","topicId":"cnm_p188"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"用圆规画圆时两脚之间的距离是 5 厘米。这个圆的直径是多少厘米？","answer":"10","explanation":"两脚距离等于半径，直径＝5×2＝10。","verify":"5*2","id":"cnm_p188_q4","topicId":"cnm_p188"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"圆周率大约是多少？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"3.14"},{"key":"B","text":"3.41"},{"key":"C","text":"31.4"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"周长÷直径≈3.14。这里计算用 314/100。","id":"cnm_p189_q1","topicId":"cnm_p189"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"圆周率等于圆的周长与什么的比值？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"直径"},{"key":"B","text":"半径"},{"key":"C","text":"面积"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"圆周率＝周长÷直径。","id":"cnm_p189_q2","topicId":"cnm_p189"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"直径 2 厘米的圆，周长大约多少厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"6.28","explanation":"周长＝直径×圆周率＝2×3.14＝6.28。","verify":"2*314/100","id":"cnm_p189_q3","topicId":"cnm_p189"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个圆的直径是 10 厘米，周长大约是 31.4 厘米。周长大约是直径的多少倍？（用小数作答）","answer":"3.14","explanation":"31.4÷10＝3.14，这个倍数就是圆周率。","verify":"314/100","id":"cnm_p189_q4","topicId":"cnm_p189"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"半径 2 厘米的圆，周长是多少厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"12.56","explanation":"周长＝2×3.14×2＝12.56。","verify":"2*314/100*2","id":"cnm_p190_q1","topicId":"cnm_p190"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"半径 5 厘米的圆，周长是多少厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"31.4","explanation":"周长＝2×3.14×5＝31.4。","verify":"2*314/100*5","id":"cnm_p190_q2","topicId":"cnm_p190"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个圆的直径是 4 厘米。它的周长是多少厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"12.56","explanation":"周长＝3.14×直径＝3.14×4＝12.56。","verify":"314/100*4","id":"cnm_p190_q3","topicId":"cnm_p190"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"圆形花坛的半径是 10 米。沿花坛围一圈篱笆，篱笆大约长多少米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"62.8","explanation":"篱笆长等于周长：2×3.14×10＝62.8。","verify":"2*314/100*10","id":"cnm_p190_q4","topicId":"cnm_p190"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"自行车车轮的直径是 50 厘米。车轮滚动一周，大约前进多少厘米？圆周率按 314/100。","answer":"157","explanation":"前进的距离等于周长：3.14×50＝157。","verify":"314/100*50","id":"cnm_p191_q1","topicId":"cnm_p191"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"圆形跑道的半径是 20 米。跑一圈大约多少米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"125.6","explanation":"2×3.14×20＝125.6。","verify":"2*314/100*20","id":"cnm_p191_q2","topicId":"cnm_p191"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"圆形花坛直径 20 米，沿边缘围一圈篱笆大约多少米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"62.8","explanation":"3.14×20＝62.8。","verify":"314/100*20","id":"cnm_p191_q3","topicId":"cnm_p191"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"钟面上时针长 5 厘米。时针走一圈，针尖大约走过多少厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"31.4","explanation":"针尖走过的是半径 5 厘米的圆周长：2×3.14×5＝31.4。","verify":"2*314/100*5","id":"cnm_p191_q4","topicId":"cnm_p191"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"半径 2 厘米的圆，面积是多少平方厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"12.56","explanation":"面积＝3.14×2×2＝12.56。","verify":"314/100*2*2","id":"cnm_p192_q1","topicId":"cnm_p192"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"半径 10 厘米的圆，面积是多少平方厘米？圆周率按 314/100。","answer":"314","explanation":"面积＝3.14×10×10＝314。","verify":"314/100*10*10","id":"cnm_p192_q2","topicId":"cnm_p192"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"半径 5 厘米的圆，面积是多少平方厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"78.5","explanation":"3.14×5×5＝78.5。","verify":"314/100*5*5","id":"cnm_p192_q3","topicId":"cnm_p192"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个圆的直径是 8 厘米。它的面积是多少平方厘米？圆周率按 314/100。（用小数作答）","answer":"50.24","explanation":"半径＝4 厘米，面积＝3.14×4×4＝50.24。","verify":"314/100*4*4","id":"cnm_p192_q4","topicId":"cnm_p192"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"扇形是由什么围成的图形？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一条半径和一条直径"},{"key":"B","text":"两条半径和一段弧"},{"key":"C","text":"两条直径和一段弧"},{"key":"D","text":"两条弧"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"扇形是由圆心角的两条半径和圆心角所对的一段弧围成的图形。","id":"cnm_p193_q1","topicId":"cnm_p193"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"圆心角是 90 度的扇形，占整个圆的几分之几？","answer":"1/4","explanation":"90÷360＝1/4。","verify":"90/360","id":"cnm_p193_q2","topicId":"cnm_p193"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"圆心角是 180 度的扇形，占整个圆的几分之几？","answer":"1/2","explanation":"180÷360＝1/2。","verify":"180/360","id":"cnm_p193_q3","topicId":"cnm_p193"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个扇形的圆心角是 120 度。它的面积是整个圆面积的几分之几？","answer":"1/3","explanation":"120÷360＝1/3。","verify":"120/360","id":"cnm_p193_q4","topicId":"cnm_p193"}]
